the leaf took margins from its consumer: true
the convolution is the zero-padded correlation of the leaf's data: true
the leaf reads back as its data, margins not included: true
the leaf's gradient is the transposed convolution of w: true
refusal: Operation padding (left=1, right=2) exceeds resolved padding (left=0, right=0) of the operand #0 x: its buffer layout was committed at creation, since it keeps the array it was given (wrap, wrap_padded, wrap_param, a loaded checkpoint). Create the data through reshape or init, which copy it into a padded buffer, or through wrap_padded with margins of at least (left=1, right=2); or read through a materialized copy of the operand (for a padded max-pool, Nn_blocks.max_pool2d_copy)
refusal: Operation padding (left=1, right=2) exceeds resolved padding (left=0, right=0) of the operand #0 x: its buffer layout was committed at its first compilation or host access, before this padded consumer was composed. Compose the padded consumer before that first compilation or host access, or read through a materialized copy of the operand (for a padded max-pool, Nn_blocks.max_pool2d_copy)
